⍝ Partition.tc
⍝ ════════════

⍝@ test4.

      ⎕IO←1

      ⍝ Precond: A simple scalar/vector nonneg int; B nonscalar
      ⍝ inv: ⍴⍴Z ←→ ⍴⍴B
      ⍝ inv: ≡Z ←→ 1+≡B
      B ← ⎕RVAL 1 (,8) (,0 1 0 0 0)
      A ← 0 1 1 2 0 2 3 3
      Z ← A⊂B
      (⍴⍴Z) ≡ ⍴⍴B
1
      ≡Z
2
      ⍝ inv: B ←→ ⊃,/A2⊂B   (re-assemble = original; A2 has no zeros)
      A2 ← 1 1 2 2 3 3 4 4
      B ≡ ⊃,/A2⊂B
1
      ⍝ inv: (0≠A)/B ←→ ⊃,/A⊂B   (non-zero selected items)
      ((0≠A)/B) ≡ ⊃,/A⊂B
1
      ⍝ inv: P/B ←→ ⊃,/P⊂B  for Boolean P
      P ← 1 0 1 1 0 1 1 0
      (P/B) ≡ ⊃,/P⊂B
1
